  startDelay: 1.5
  pages:
  - descriptionText: Check the level's to-do list  completed tasks will be crossed
      out. Once all cleaning tasks are finished you will enter Decoration Phrase
    tutorialImage: {fileID: 1733249497515002832, guid: df60e6c5e6d86cc49b76119aa2d298d7, type: 3}
  - descriptionText: Press the button to spawn a trash can in the house, then tap
      to collect trash and put it in the bin until you reach the target amount
    tutorialImage: {fileID: -3407457224876889944, guid: b8e8a77e74657dc4e9fcdab4fced49e9, type: 3}
  - descriptionText: Press the button to spawn a mop to clean up dirt and stains.
      A percentage indicator will show your cleaning progress.
    tutorialImage: {fileID: -7945798417389578265, guid: a167158718851f245b5e346fef8844ed, type: 3}
  popDuration: 0.5
  openEase: 27
  closeEase: 26
